<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17377" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθήμερ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made</i> or <i>done on
				the very day,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. ἀναπλάσσεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι</span>
			<i>extemporaneous</i> speeches, prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ημερόν</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.208
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακον αὐ.</span> curing <i>in one
				day,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.755
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθημερόν</span></b>  (on the accent
				v. Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.491
			</span></i>) <i>on the very day, on the same day, immediately,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				456
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				522
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.89
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθήμερα</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτημερόν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.122
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.139
			</span></i> (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθ-</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.10
			</span></i>); 
				Locr.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταμαρόν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).334.33
			</span></i>; 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθαμέραν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				559.57
			</span></i> (Megalop.); Cret. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐταμερίν</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				4999
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>).</div>
